      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pavahwikile nchilambo cha ku Kanaani kwa Yakobo atatawao, vanang'o nkunnyaulila lammalele lavakojîje uvachidoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nkulungwa wa chilambo achila átangola na hwetu kwa kukalipa, na kutwona hwetu kuva tuvapelelesi nchilambo chake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henga hwetu nkunnyaulila kuva, hwetu ni tuvanu tuvakukulupika, na wala akee tuvapelelesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hwetu nkunnyaulila kuva, hwetu twavele tuvana kumi na mbili tùvá atata yumo, na kuva, nnung'unwetu ànihila na nnung'unwetu wa chihwangwa àvele kukaya, nchilambo cha ku Kanaani pamo na atata wetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anepo ayula nkulungwa wa chilambo achila nkutuhaulila kuchidoni, ‘Uvila njo chinimbemala kuva muhiu mwenu ni mmanu mukulupika. Nneke apano munu yumo mmwenu, koka mwenu mupelekeje vilyo kwa alangavenu vavêle na indala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahi pamumbeuya aneko mulangane na nnung'unwenu wa chihwangwa, na anepo njo panimbemala kuva mwenu mukee mmapelelesi ila ni mmanu mukulupîka. Mukàtenda uchocho, nangu nguchininchimulile nnilungu nkulwenu, na muchimuluhusiwe kusuma na kusumisa nchilambo achino.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pavachikuchula vilyo mmagunila lao, nkukangana pavawene kila munu vammuihijìjè chihwitiki chake cha madini la dihela nnigunila lyake. Pavalawene anelo, vammalele pamo na atata wao nkuyopa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo atata wao nkuvahaulila kuchidoni, “Mwenu mùngupakanywele vana vangu! Yusufu akapali, na Simeoni akapali, na vino mùlembela muntwale na Benjamini. Anelo lammalele làngukoja chihi unene!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anepo Lubeni nkunnyaulila atatake kuchidoni, “Nikànauye na Benjamini, bahi vawalale anavangu vavili. Nneke Benjamini mmakono langu, nanangu nguchininchunge na kuuya nawe apano.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 42:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henga atatake nkunnyang'ula kuchidoni, “Mwanangu nanga pambelangana na mwenu. Nkuluwe ànihila, nang'e weka njo aisalidîle. Na nangu vino nni nsele nguvêle na dihulisi. Na lakànkoja mambo mabaya mmwanda umuhwena, nguchinguhwe na lihindambi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.42.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.42.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
